# Generated art (7 GB): Meshy task records hold signed URLs, and models, rigs and renders are
# large. Kept local until the art pipeline picks a home. The game needs none of it: it loads the
# published meshes and textures by id (src/client/Visuals/MeshMonsterAssets.luau), and
# art/export is re-made from the rigs by tools/blender/pipeline.py.
art/meshy/
art/rigs/
art/blender/
art/compare/
art/export/
art/tripo/
art/rbxgen/

# Python bytecode from the art tools.
__pycache__/
